- LiveCodeBench / SciCode / AA-SciCode / Vibe Code Bench: no verified public score found
- DeepSWE / Coding Index / SWE-Lancer / other: no verified public score found

Long context:

- 128k window at launch; no long-context retrieval reported.

Negative-findings notes:

- Zero verified public quality benchmark numbers for this exact model/ID. The only public performance claims are speed (>1000 tok/s on Cerebras WSE-3) and the qualitative SWE-Bench Pro / Terminal-Bench 2.0 "strong performance" chart from the launch post.
- Not listed in the OpenAI API docs model catalog or API changelog; no Artificial Analysis page; not in the GPT-5.3-Codex system card scope.
- Safety: same safety training as mainline models incl. cyber; OpenAI's standard evaluation found no plausible chance of reaching High capability in cybersecurity or biology (launch post).
- Zero verified public benchmark numbers for this exact model/ID → saved as `.md.excluded` per the template's SELF-EXCLUSION rule. Re-research once independent scores (SWE-bench, TB2.x, AA Index) are published.

